WEBVTT

00:11:32.104 --> 00:11:35.858
The sound of your neighbors’
screams being carried away

00:11:35.899 --> 00:11:37.443
in that same wind.

00:11:38.068 --> 00:11:39.236
The “What if?”

00:11:41.488 --> 00:11:43.115
"What if they don't make it?"

00:11:45.284 --> 00:11:47.995
"What if we don't make it?"

00:11:49.371 --> 00:11:51.081
"What if I don't make it?"

00:11:52.249 --> 00:11:53.500
"What if?"

00:11:55.544 --> 00:12:00.841
But what if we could design away
some of that uncertainty